{"script":"sj_005_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1a","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"y":-297,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara005_1","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1a","transTime":300,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"y":-297,"scaleX":1,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara005_1","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊，是的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]之前我不是说想给营地帮点忙嘛。我回旅店搬点食材过来，给你们露一手我的厨艺。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你说私自挪用驿站的物资会不会不太好？并不是这样。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]说是从旅店拿，其实是属于我自己的配给份额。我自己食量其实挺少的，吃不完就都留在地窖里了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]正好最近总是来你们这边叨扰，我个人也想做些什么当做回报。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你说……到时候我们一起来做菜？啊，的确。听米托拉说过，你对烹饪也是略有研究吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯……那太好了。真没想到侍者队外还有烹饪同好，真令人意外。我很期待之后的加班哦，让我见识见识你的实力吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-准备出门？有什么事吗？"}